<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <%- include('_admin-theme') %>
</head>
<body class="admin-body">
  <div class="admin-layout">
    <%- include('_nav') %>
    <main class="admin-main">
      <h1 class="admin-page-title">运维中心</h1>
      <p class="admin-page-sub">维护赛程、阵容与赛前情报；不懂代码也能完成日常操作。</p>

      <% if (locals.flashMsg) { %><p class="admin-flash-ok"><%= locals.flashMsg %></p><% } %>
      <% if (locals.flashErr) { %><p class="admin-flash-err"><%= locals.flashErr %></p><% } %>

      <% var avBase = (typeof locals.adminViewPathPrefix !== 'undefined' && locals.adminViewPathPrefix) ? locals.adminViewPathPrefix : '/admin-view'; %>
      <% var h = locals.envHints || {}; %>
      <% var afKey = !!h.hasApiFootballKey; %>
      <% var fdKey = !!h.hasFootballDataKey; %>
      <% var dsKey = !!h.hasDeepseekKey && !h.enableMockDeepseek; %>
      <% var cronOn = !!h.enableCronSync; %>

      <p class="admin-ops-intro">
        本产品面向球迷提供<strong>赛前 AI 情报与报告</strong>。后台日常三件事：<strong>同步比赛与名单</strong>、<strong>刷新比分</strong>、在单场页<strong>生成预测与情报</strong>。复杂选项（改赛季、改联赛代码、StatsBomb 等）在侧栏「高级与排障」里。
      </p>

      <ul class="admin-status-simple" aria-label="连接状态">
        <li class="<%= afKey ? 'ok' : 'warn' %>">赛程 / 阵容主数据源（API-Football）<%= afKey ? '已配置' : '未配置 Key' %></li>
        <li class="<%= fdKey ? 'ok' : 'warn' %>">辅助数据（Football-Data）<%= fdKey ? '已配置' : '未配置' %></li>
        <li class="<%= dsKey ? 'ok' : 'warn' %>">AI 写作（DeepSeek）<%= h.enableMockDeepseek ? '当前为模拟' : (dsKey ? '真实 Key' : '未配置') %></li>
        <li class="<%= cronOn ? 'ok' : 'warn' %>">服务器定时任务 <%= cronOn ? '已开启' : '未开启' %></li>
      </ul>

      <section class="admin-card" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        <h2 class="admin-card-title">数据概览</h2>
        <div class="admin-grid-stats">
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>库内比赛</small><span><%= matchCount %></span></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>今日比赛</small><span><%= todayMatches %></span></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>已发布报告</small><span><%= publishedReports %></span></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>订单（总）</small><span><%= orderCount %></span></div>
          <% if (typeof intelGapMatches !== 'undefined') { %>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>近窗缺预测</small><span title="未来约 <%= autoIntelLookaheadHours %> 小时内、尚未生成预测的场次"><%= intelGapMatches %></span></div>
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <p class="admin-muted" style="margin:0;">
          <a href="<%= avBase %>/matches">打开比赛列表</a>
          · <a href="<%= avBase %>/orders">订单</a>
          · <a href="<%= avBase %>/data-report">数据报表</a>
          · <a href="<%= avBase %>/data-ingest">高级 · 数据入库</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <h2 class="admin-card-title" style="margin:0 0 0.75rem;font-size:0.75rem;">一键同步（默认五大联赛 + 欧战，赛季 2025/26）</h2>
      <div class="admin-ops-grid">
        <div class="admin-ops-tile">
          <h3>① 同步赛程</h3>
          <p>从 API-Football 拉最近赛程写入数据库。需先配置环境变量里的 API-Football Key。</p>
          <% if (!afKey) { %>
            <p class="admin-flash-err" style="margin:0;">请先在平台配置 <code>API_FOOTBALL_API_KEY</code> 并重启服务。</p>
          <% } else { %>
          <form method="post" action="<%= avBase %>/data-ingest/actions/api-football-fixtures">
            <input type="hidden" name="codes" value="PL,PD,SA,BL1,FL1,CL,EL,UECL" />
            <input type="hidden" name="season" value="2025" />
            <input type="hidden" name="delay-between-ms" value="1350" />
            <input type="hidden" name="max-pages" value="40" />
            <button type="submit" class="admin-btn">开始同步赛程</button>
          </form>
          <% } %>
          <p class="admin-ops-foot">要改联赛或赛季：侧栏「数据入库（全选项）」。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-ops-tile">
          <h3>② 同步球员名单</h3>
          <p>在赛程同步成功后再点。把各队大名单写入库，供情报与展示使用。</p>
          <% if (!afKey) { %>
            <p class="admin-flash-err" style="margin:0;">需 API-Football Key。</p>
          <% } else { %>
          <form method="post" action="<%= avBase %>/data-ingest/actions/api-football-squads">
            <input type="hidden" name="codes" value="PL,PD,SA,BL1,FL1,CL,EL,UECL" />
            <input type="hidden" name="season" value="2025" />
            <input type="hidden" name="delay-between-ms" value="2200" />
            <input type="hidden" name="max-teams" value="24" />
            <button type="submit" class="admin-btn">开始同步名单</button>
          </form>
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-ops-tile">
          <h3>③ 刷新进行中比分</h3>
          <p>比赛已开始但比分未更新时点这里（与服务器定时任务逻辑相同）。</p>
          <form method="post" action="<%= avBase %>/data-ingest/actions/poll-recent-fd-match-status">
            <button type="submit" class="admin-btn secondary">刷新近窗比分</button>
          </form>
          <p class="admin-ops-foot">若仍不更新，请确认已配置 API-Football 或 FD Key，并查看「接口日志」。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-ops-tile">
          <h3>④ 辅助：Football-Data 全量基础</h3>
          <p>可选。用于队徽、辅助赛程等（较慢，需 FD Key）。</p>
          <% if (!fdKey) { %>
            <p class="admin-muted" style="margin:0;">未配置 FD Key 时无法使用。</p>
          <% } else { %>
          <form method="post" action="<%= avBase %>/dashboard/sync-all-basic">
            <button type="submit" class="admin-btn secondary">触发 FD 基础同步</button>
          </form>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="admin-card">
        <h2 class="admin-card-title">自动补预测（多场比赛）</h2>
        <p class="admin-muted" style="margin:0 0 0.85rem;">对最近一段时间里<strong>还没有预测</strong>的比赛批量生成。日常可交给服务器定时任务；这里用于手动立即跑一轮。</p>
        <form method="post" action="<%= avBase %>/dashboard/actions/auto-intel-run" class="admin-form-row" style="margin:0;align-items:center;">
          <input type="hidden" name="lookahead-hours" value="72" />
          <input type="hidden" name="lookback-hours" value="12" />
          <input type="hidden" name="max-matches" value="15" />
          <input type="hidden" name="delay-ms" value="2000" />
          <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;margin:0;">
            <span class="admin-muted">模式</span>
            <select name="mode" style="padding:0.4rem 0.5rem;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--admin-border);background:var(--admin-surface-solid);color:var(--admin-text);">
              <option value="prediction" selected>只补预测（推荐）</option>
              <option value="full">整场情报管线（慢，耗 AI）</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.35rem;margin:0 0 0 0.5rem;font-size:0.8rem;cursor:pointer;color:var(--admin-muted);">
            <input type="checkbox" name="include-ai-report" value="1" />
            full 时连 AI 报告草稿一起跑
          </label>
          <button type="submit" class="admin-btn" style="margin-left:0.5rem;">立即执行一轮</button>
        </form>
        <p class="admin-muted" style="margin:0.75rem 0 0;font-size:0.78rem;">单场精细操作请打开「比赛列表」进入对应场次。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="admin-card">
        <h2 class="admin-card-title">其它</h2>
        <div class="admin-btn-row">
          <form method="post" action="<%= avBase %>/dashboard/actions/seed-tournaments">
            <button type="submit" class="admin-btn secondary">写入默认赛事结构</button>
          </form>
        </div>
        <p class="admin-muted" style="margin:0.75rem 0 0;">新环境第一次用库时可点一次；已有数据时通常不需要。</p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
